-#  Module Name:         eeprom-read-mac.sh
-#  Project Name:        UltraZed IIC EEPROM Read MAC ID Script
-#  Target Devices:      Xilinx Zynq and Zynq UltraScale+ MPSoC
-#  Hardware Boards:     UltraZed-EG + I/O Carrier
-#                       UltraZed-EG + PCIe Carrier
