-#  Module Name:         isb_gadget_ethernet.sh
-#  Project Name:        USB gadget Ethernet Setup Script
-#  Target Devices:      Xilinx Zynq and Zynq UltraScale+ MPSoC
-#  Hardware Boards:     Ultra96-V2
-# 
-#  Tool versions:       Xilinx Vivado 2020.1
