-/******************** (C) COPYRIGHT 2015 STMicroelectronics ********************
-*
-* File Name          : lis2ds_i2c.c
-* Authors            : AMS - VMU - Application Team
-*		     : Giuseppe Barba <giuseppe.barba@st.com>
-*		     : Author is willing to be considered the contact and update
